{"sections":[{"slug":"极化流形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"极化流形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">极化流形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“极化流形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">极化流形</span> (polarized manifold) <span lang=\"zh\">是紧</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $L$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/代数簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是极化流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $\\mathbb P^n(\\mathbb{C})$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的线丛</span> $\\mathcal O(1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拉回是一个正线丛</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/小平嵌入定理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">小平嵌入定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是上述命题的逆</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}